  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tPayroll\n\t\tPayroll Help Guide\n\n### Smart Pension PAPDIS File\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Wed, 15 Sep, 2021 at  4:03 PM\n\n\t\tLocation: \n\nPayroll Dashboard > Select a Client > Auto Enrolment > Pension Schemes > Contribution button\n\nPAPDIS - short for the Payroll and Pension Data Interface Standard. It's free and open standard designed to help payroll systems to transfer information to pension providers.\n\nHelp Guide:\n\nWe have provided the option to download the Smart Pension Contribution file in the required PAPDIS format. \n\nTo do this, head to the navigation above and once there, click Contribution, you will be presented with the below pop-up interface - simply click Download.\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
